[{"title":"登朝天岭","author":"魏初","text":"余来汉中凡三年，大山小山行欲遍。\n今年复有东川行，大抵势随岗阜转。\n石头荦确颠且危，不独心惊梦亦战。\n利州城北到朝天，又是川行山一变。\n悬崖皴涩留苔青，石罅阴森郁松茜。\n得诗数语疑有神，得酒百杯亦不倦。\n回环应接奇无穷，乃见平时所未见。\n落落参军正紫髯，行行御史真铁面。\n相看大醉复长歌，灭没春鸿天一线。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10343,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"适安堂","author":"魏初","text":"穷通有定分，流坎无庸悲。\n湘累自苦亦太隘，韩子孤愤将奚为。\n人生百年浑几时，鼠窥鬼瞰徒成私。\n何如樊川一樽酒，往者莫究今已而。\n秦川如画渭如丝，韦曲杜曲无声诗。\n高堂驾空竹树里，觚棱潇洒含幽姿。\n起居饮食颇自适，不矫不饰随所施。\n举手为谢昌黎师，乃今平原能得之。\n有时高咏归来辞，有时独酌芙蓉卮。\n人间所得容力取，委之顺之夫何思。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10344,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"韩监察所藏画马","author":"魏初","text":"房星降精云晦明，天机灭没麒麟行。\n逸群绝足岂易得，侧身伫目长风生。\n忆昔周王走八极，不惜千金买奇骨。\n浮云追电迤逦至，千里瑶池才一蹴。\n汉家沙苑唐虎臣，队色满山云锦新。\n只今雄骏竟寂寞，转益愁向驽骀群。\n吁嗟冀北亦古国，安得天骥曾不闻。\n驾辕伏枥计必有，王良伯乐谁其人。\n韩卿好古得此图，索遍乌台好诗客。\n侵晨打门惊梦觉，开卷金石声㗲㗲。\n雨中破屋百不遂，才薄何以塞君责。\n此图一日当飞去，看避青骢洛阳陌。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10345,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"游玉泉","author":"魏初","text":"少时尝读子虚赋，爱其胸中云梦，淮湘鄂越历历生风雨。\n我思古人何悠悠，遂欲大放心颜，挥斥八极鞭九州。\n谁其捉我坐屋底，壮心不死庸有几。\n玉泉一觌凡五年，风水咫尺如千里。\n孙刘爱厚有嘉招，温诗历落亦奇士。\n郜侯俊秀甫远来，骐骥不惭驽与齿。\n借驴肩酒穿村行，云烟草树来寻盟。\n初盘山腰探龙窟，空明鸿洞玻瓈青。\n买鱼酾酒放船入，鳌头掀舞蛟人泣。\n鼓楫敲舷凌浩荡，嵓崖倒影屏风湿。\n君能为我倾倒双白瓶，我欲为君?醉一吸复一吸。\n沉竿续蔓不可测，黑绿阴深五千尺。\n杳然心悸身生芒，泊岸为著灵运屐。\n攀缘古柏上层巅，细路蜿蜒绕䲔脊。\n万古风从鸟道来，夕阳天影凝空碧。\n解衣小憩足力生，西南更觅丹丘迹。\n人生天地逆旅间，贵无等伦惟有閒。\n功名既不麒麟阁，箕颖自合相追攀。\n折腰摧眉必不已，役役没没谁尔怜。\n我知此理有定论，所遇所穷或者天。\n东山歌酒乃大起，夜郎醉月终其年。\n古贤出处各有以，安吾见在清樽前。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10346,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"观象诗","author":"魏初","text":"皇帝马箠开云南，始得一象来中国。\n中国传闻未尝见，一日争睹轰霹雳。\n巨鼻引地六七尺，左卷右舒为口役。\n耳项垂垂倍数牛，皮毛苍苍艾豭黑。\n目竖青荧镜有光，背阔隐嶙山之脊。\n卷发蛮奴铁作钩，要将驱使惊九州。\n吾闻国家方宝贤，异物自至非所求。\n谁能更上旅獒篇，清风万古追西周。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10347,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"送刘祥卿之上都","author":"魏初","text":"笔砚相从日，于今四十年。\n关山长契阔，尊酒暂留连。\n汾水秋风里，滦江霁雪边。\n故人如见问，为说已华颠。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10348,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"送张梦符","author":"魏初","text":"磊落衣冠旧，诗书照眼青。\n礼闱今妙选，宪府昔才名。\n汉水三千梦，钱塘十里亭。\n殷勤一杯酒，江海望澄清。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10349,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"送叶亦愚","author":"魏初","text":"向在诸生列，孤危斥老奸。\n今逢太平日，咫尺拜天颜。\n尽已都俞际，无心用舍间。\n钱塘八九月，秋色满吴山。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10350,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"挽吕丈子谦","author":"魏初","text":"忆昔京都日，青山拜上庠。\n只今江海外，白发见诸郎。\n行业谁先后，功名竟茫。\n无从酹秋草，三复白云章。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10351,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"褒城即席送何侍御","author":"魏初","text":"话别京都后，音书随渺茫。\n相逢汉皋上，鞍马又匆忙。\n我泪狄仁杰，君评许子将。\n殷勤一杯酒，此去重相望。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10352,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"送某学士","author":"魏初","text":"鲁斋天下士，高弟数君侯。\n立学心恒切，居官行益修。\n旱苗方渴雨，健翮正横秋。\n尊酒何年夜，陈登百尺楼。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10353,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"送杨子裕参政赴江西省","author":"魏初","text":"世契前朝旧，台联此日同。\n才谋知缓急，肝胆见清忠。\n江海风烟里，疮痍煦燠中。\n太平十二策，正要沃宸聪。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10354,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"梦弟妹有感","author":"魏初","text":"弟妹飘零久，羹墙念虑间。\n相逢应有日，比老合投閒。\n梦逐鸡声断，心随马影还。\n清明寒食近，烟雨万重山。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10355,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"顺圣温泉留题","author":"魏初","text":"破冢风霜里，诸孙肮脏边。\n龟趺埋老藓，翁仲卧荒烟。\n宗邑嗟谁起，文源愧我传。\n一杯清酹底，聊与慰重泉。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10356,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"为唐佐弟寿","author":"魏初","text":"兄弟惟君我，相看半白头。\n迩来方聚首，今又问行舟。\n风雨山窗夜，鸡豚石涧秋。\n此期须有日，灯火读书楼。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10357,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"三次雷苦斋韵二首 其一","author":"魏初","text":"鞍马黄尘已强颜，更堪白发镜中看。\n曾陪尊俎回春煖，正想音书慰客寒。\n胜览足供诗笔健，相思今觉带围宽。\n长江一碧横千里，无复秋风细有澜。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10358,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"三次雷苦斋韵二首 其二","author":"魏初","text":"三仕陪从契分深，每高谈议豁尘襟。\n十年脚有随车雨，一片心无徙木金。\n晴雪梅花曾汉上，白云秋水又汾阴。\n黑河沙土扬州月，别后相思直到今。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10359,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"次男必复韵","author":"魏初","text":"心头何事最相关，一片飞云万叠山。\n去驿隔年才得信，分司六月不知还。\n身归造物乘除里，意在经营惨澹间。\n为报金兰何侍御，别来今已鬓毛斑。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10360,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"奉次明叔赵君见寄诗韵","author":"魏初","text":"尝拟骚人作问天，贤愚谁后复谁前。\n尘冠一拂岂徒尔，霜简千年要凛然。\n自许已知吾计拙，并驱那敢子争先。\n南风雁足诗来好，归思遥生秋草边。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10361,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"次重云俊公韵","author":"魏初","text":"山中月影共婆娑，发兴题诗墨自磨。\n空负有言如郑直，未能遽止似商讹。\n本来抟击风棱少，此去归休意思多。\n且喜居延凡两月，与君时一到无何。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10362,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"寿御史中丞","author":"魏初","text":"丞相勋名纪太常，君侯忠鲠复腾光。\n青宫意注文贞笏，白简风生肃政堂。\n守道自当成豹变，击强初不待鹰扬。\n黑头事业磨崖颂，要共生平日月长。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10363,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"白塔遇表兄刘君","author":"魏初","text":"蜀道山尖上似天，谦河雪片大如绵。\n兵尘澒洞七千里，音信消沉十一年。\n马上相逢有今日，镜中惊叹各华颠。\n几时收拾田园了，风雨灯窗共醉眠。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10364,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"拜诏","author":"魏初","text":"五更朝马簇金沟，共待鸡人报晓筹。\n万国衣冠有今日，九天宫阙照神州。\n紫泥书带炉香拆，赤羽旗随日影流。\n一片嵩呼春色里，戴盆何幸望宸旒。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10365,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"拜诏次尚书刘公韵","author":"魏初","text":"龙旆霓旌夹两阶，九重阊阖一时开。\n千官花底瞻天拜，双凤云间捧诏来。\n生意根荄如启蛰，欢声朝野似闻雷。\n小臣虮虱浑无补，愿酌春江酹寿杯。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10366,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"通明阁","author":"魏初","text":"千尺觚棱北斗横，一川烟树冷云平。\n瀛洲方丈知何在，渭水终南画不成。\n天上碧桃青凤啄，月边瑶草白龙耕。\n自怜未断人间梦，赤日黄尘六月行。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10367,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"子阳李兄与余家交三世矣故于初颇相爱念子阳才疏意广不屑细务且知时命未偶因放浪于诗酒泉石之间尝自赵抵淇由洛阳登华山至长安而还得诗文二十馀篇皆名公投赠之什也至元十一年初以事来镇阳得遂披读敬书五十六字以发挥吾子阳襟期之梗槩云","author":"魏初","text":"不是孤高不爱官，只缘行路古来难。\n一杯径醉从人笑，万事无吾着眼看。\n安得暂离尘梦里，放教高卧冷云端。\n此心此话谁能会，邂逅青灯几夜阑。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10368,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"赠答商台符","author":"魏初","text":"玉削青尖太华山，君家名胜百年间。\n相公开府今分陕，吾子承家又铸颜。\n诗似晚江晴浪捲，心如春水白鸥闲。\n自怜南北成何事，粗向交情见一斑。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10369,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"奉赠虚极刘仙翁","author":"魏初","text":"闻说秦州地上仙，心无一物思飘然。\n云山想像俱成画，杖屦追随惜未缘。\n引鹤看花秋径里，枕书听雨夜窗前。\n回头尘土三千丈，何处人间有洞天。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10370,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"次韵答左丞杨中斋","author":"魏初","text":"每惊尘虑顿成空，曾接君侯玉麈风。\n青眼相看文字里，丹心都在简书中。\n一时人物谁轻重，千古讥评几异同。\n明日洪都宪司去，不能无意失诸公。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10371,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"青霞观","author":"魏初","text":"花枝欹曲竹勾连，中有青眉地上仙。\n清露和香殊旖旎，晚风吹鹤更蹁跹。\n只知尽里今无笔，谁信人间别有天。\n叫断青鸾飞不到，黄尘一隔路三千。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10372,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"得男必复书","author":"魏初","text":"来时暑雨拍车头，到日冬烟压草楼。\n酒为瘴来须强饮，书因家远屡轻投。\n计回蜀道一千里，遍走秦川八九州。\n咫尺还司敢停脚，西南又入剑门秋。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10373,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"挽孟待制驾之","author":"魏初","text":"有志明时竟不伸，士林公议惜斯人。\n秋风断雁从谁托，老木清霜见本真。\n草草杯盘千里别，悠悠天地一丘尘。\n题诗忘却伤心处，为是传家有凤麟。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10374,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"读汪氏义武忠烈二碑","author":"魏初","text":"矫矫风神义与忠，堂堂父子陇西公。\n孤城抗节前朝事，万死开边此日功。\n上国贤藩俱倚重，诸孙此志独称雄。\n两碑读罢登高望，落日祠堂满树风。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10375,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"送梁贡父","author":"魏初","text":"少日骞腾鹰脱鞲，牂牁秋色上吴钩。\n五年直到天低处，万里生还海尽头。\n尊酒相逢有今日，恶怀无复论穷愁。\n此行敷奏蛮荒了，合近天家五凤楼。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10376,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"挽陈参卿季渊","author":"魏初","text":"文源浩汗接元麻，诗律新奇自一家。\n人物百年谁鹗表，秋风孤剑几龙沙。\n膝横坡老敲门杖，头戴渊明漉酒纱。\n恨煞归来才几日，白杨原上闹啼鸦。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10377,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"挽殷佥事献臣","author":"魏初","text":"曾扈龙旗北斗傍，远持使节到扶桑。\n性情邃密希前宋，诗笔淋漓近晚唐。\n方倚细陈清泪疏，不期便入白云乡。\n伤心千里燕南道，落日鸦啼垄树苍。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10378,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"次前韵赠雷苦斋侍御","author":"魏初","text":"倚遍江湖寺寺楼，却乘骢马到西州。\n心如老柏千年雪，节似苍崖万仞秋。\n公议自当归宿望，时评且莫叹迟留。\n萱堂强健儿知学，底是君侯可用愁。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10379,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"送程侍御钜夫","author":"魏初","text":"一封丹诏九天来，御史青骢翰苑才。\n廊庙久劳思稷契，丘园初不望邹枚。\n定知天下无双士，正在君侯此一回。\n自昔楚材为晋用，中原麟凤莫深猜。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10380,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"青宫赐教化参政海青","author":"魏初","text":"瀚海东边百尺崖，崖头霜鹘矗云开。\n红香晓动千官合，绿涨春围万马来。\n俊气共知为异物，老拳真见不凡材。\n当时宠锡非无意，已有光辉极上台。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10381,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"赐蒙固岱平章海青","author":"魏初","text":"海东青鹘气凌空，锦臂绦笼下九重。\n春水才溶千顷绿，头鹅已落半天风。\n须知神物不易得，自是圣皇酬有功。\n丞相黑头谁与比，此心正要答宸衷。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10382,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"张提刑向尹大兴天子以二海青宠锡之未几拜兹命则知睿眷之有在也于其行作诗以勉之","author":"魏初","text":"龙旗簇仗暖生烟，鸷鸟搏空控老拳。\n万里风头飞雪急，千官影里得春偏。\n也知颦笑非徒尔，始信澄清不偶然。\n为报山鸡莫回首，雄心长在碧云边。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10383,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"吾乡之崖有以青得名者余尝取以自号至元十四年偕御史国瑞外郎周卿有东州之行道出阆州阆之南二十馀里佛阁突兀因周览形胜得河南人王子京青崖石刻不知阆之崖与吾乡之崖一而二者耶抑海内一家山川脉络同一元气二而一者耶或其偶与之合耶乃书此以识","author":"魏初","text":"遥遥阁道倚空青，湛湛澄江练影横。\n千佛参差半天上，四山环合一川平。\n云间烟火无閒地，画里升平有此行。\n乡国三年六千里，偶于仙苑见崖名。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10384,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"留别宪府诸公","author":"魏初","text":"五年骢马颜何厚，一日天恩愧不任。\n共道相从有知己，定交何必到分金。\n两行清泪三年别，一片白云千里心。\n珍重凤凰池上客，明朝走马蜀山深。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10385,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"寄商左山","author":"魏初","text":"丽泽门西十里亭，记从别后几清明。\n梯航遐国归筹画，柱石中朝望老成。\n满眼青山连夜梦，一尊明月两乡情。\n花时更向东皋醉，肠断云间百二城。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10386,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"奉答廉公劝农 其一","author":"魏初","text":"小烘茶瓶带腊，新封酒瓮迎和。\n醉里西山南浦，眼前仰岭高埚。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10387,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"奉答廉公劝农 其二","author":"魏初","text":"满眼江山图画，五年风浪穷船。\n诵读愁无眼力，裁培正在心田。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10388,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"奉答廉公劝农 其三","author":"魏初","text":"章江晴绿逐春生，铁树祠前有此行。\n人笑青崖痴老子，爱君古意未忘情。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10389,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"港口舟行是日室人生日寄此为寿 其一","author":"魏初","text":"岁岁逢君此日，相望长在他州。\n风雨吴头楚尾，五年才共行舟。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10390,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"港口舟行是日室人生日寄此为寿 其二","author":"魏初","text":"今岁才春又别，洗妆应在书楼。\n细卜归来消息，荔枝红彻迎秋。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10391,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"赠高道凝 其一","author":"魏初","text":"吏部真纯玉不如，济时心彻五云车。\n中州名品存公议，先子垂亡有荐书。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10392,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"赠高道凝 其二","author":"魏初","text":"吏部文章不近名，悠然流水与云行。\n百年文柄遗山在，曾道波澜独老成。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10393,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"赠高道凝 其三","author":"魏初","text":"中郎才业自家传，际遇青宫倚注偏。\n最爱两年无一事，雍容筹笔直如椽。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10394,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"赠高道凝 其四","author":"魏初","text":"江南骢马旧知名，共喜金陵有此行。\n去去凤凰台上月，拍江风雨听秋声。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10395,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"赠李吉甫","author":"魏初","text":"故人相见眼增明，尊酒殷勤且未平。\n恨煞簿书尘土里，两年寂寞度秦城。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10396,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"赠史子桓","author":"魏初","text":"泣血寻亲白发儿，牛腰半是昔人诗。\n伤心四十年前梦，一片白云无了时。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10397,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"赠宋碧湖","author":"魏初","text":"碧湖老子识朝贤，白璧明珠有此篇。\n青眼相看岂虚语，不妨收是买山钱。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10398,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"赵伯恭母八十","author":"魏初","text":"养心戒饮不易得，谳狱平反阴有功。\n圣善寿徵应在此，百年无日不春风。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10399,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"峡山寺","author":"魏初","text":"擘破深青太华云，中浮浓绿是通津。\n画图尽有江山在，绀碧瑶环恐未真。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10400,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"宣德","author":"魏初","text":"曾侍蒲轮四月行，入冬风雪哭铭旌。\n到今三十馀年事，依旧山围水绕城。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10401,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"寄扬州金使君","author":"魏初","text":"两年不到摘星楼，雁隔江声送客愁。\n昨夜金山船上月，澹随帆影过中秋。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10402,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"柳潭垂钓","author":"魏初","text":"阴阴杨柳一丝风，脚底行云在镜中。\n不为君王肯同载，便将烟树换齐东。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10403,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"巡按京兆口占二首 其一","author":"魏初","text":"忆昨春风石马园，偶因离别却成欢。\n杯行交错殊无意，酒到轰腾不属官。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10404,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"巡按京兆口占二首 其二","author":"魏初","text":"此别分司拚数日，浑教聚首是三年。\n臣门如市心如水，有底藩篱不醉眠。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10405,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"记昔","author":"魏初","text":"宝殿光辉记昔游，川原风物入悲愁。\n儿时曾识东园老，弹指中间到白头。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10406,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}}]